Hello everyone!

Does anyone have or knows of a schematic representation of Xenomai's
architecture? By this I mean Xenomai's relationship to Adeos, the Linux
kernel, etc. all in one drawing. I want to use it to explain a total
outsider how Xenomai works, but right now I'm not even sure if I understand
it fully, because I was starting out to draw it myself, but I get confused
about the facts that Xenomai is effectively a part of the kernel (as
modules, that is), but at the same time treating the kernel as a low
priority task. Seems a bit tricky to illustrate from my (narrow) point of
view.

Thanks very much in advance!

Best regards,

Frits

